an class="head">Ajit Prasad&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br aria-hidden="true">      Deputy General Manager<br aria-hidden="true">    (Communications)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>    <p class="head">Press Release: 2026-2027/1230</p></td>  </tr></table>]]></description><link>https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63708</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 13:40:00</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Directions under Section 35A read with Section 56 of the Banking Regulation Act, 1949 – Innovative Co-operative Urban Bank Limited, New Delhi – Extension of Period]]></title><description><![CDATA[<table width="100%" border="0" align="center" class="td">  <tr>    <td><p>The Reserve Bank of India issued Directions under Section 35A read with Section 56 of the Banking Regulation Act, 1949 to Innovative Co-operative Urban Bank Limited, New Delhi vide Directive No. DEL.DOS.EXG_SSM.No.S143/12-10-005/2025-2026 dated July 03, 2025 for a period of 06 months from close of business on July 04, 2025 up to close of business on January 04, 2026, which was last extended vide Directive No. DOR.MON.D-19/12.28.123/2026-27 dated June 29, 2026. The Reserve Bank of India is satisfied that in the public interest, it is necessary to further extend the period of operation of the Directive beyond close of business on October 04, 2026.</p>    <p>2. Accordingly, the Reserve Bank of India, in the exercise of powers vested in it under sub-section (1) of Section 35A read with Section 56 of the Banking Regulation Act, 1949, hereby extends the Directive for a further period of 03 months from close of business on October 04, 2026 to close of business on January 04, 2027, subject to review.</p>    <p>3. The aforesaid extension by the Reserve Bank of India should not per-se be construed to imply that the Reserve Bank of India is satisfied with the financial position of the bank.</p>    <p>4. Other terms and conditions of the Directive under reference, shall remain unchanged.</p>    <p align="right"><span class="head">(Brij Raj)</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>      Chief General Manager</p>    <p class="head">Press Release: 2026-2027/1229</p></td>  </tr></table>]]></description><link>https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63707</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:10:00</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Result of the 4-day Variable Rate Reverse Repo (VRRR)  auction held on October 01, 2026]]></title><description><![CDATA[<table width="100%" border="0" align="center" class="td">  <tr>    <td><table width="85%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="1" class="tablebg">      <tr>        <td width="70%">Tenor</td>        <td width="30%" align="right">4-day</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Notified Amount (in &#8377; crore)</td>        <td align="right">2,00,000</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Total amount of offers received (in &#8377; crore)</td>        <td align="right">1,68,055</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Amount accepted (in &#8377; crore)</td>        <td align="right">1,68,055</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Cut off Rate (%)</td>        <td align="right">5.24</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Weighted Average Rate (%)</td>        <td align="right">5.24</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Partial Acceptance Percentage of offers received at cut off rate</td>        <td align="right">NA</td>      </tr>    </table>      <p align="right"><span class="head">Ajit Prasad</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>        Deputy General Manager<br>        (Communications)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>    <p class="head">Press Release: 2026-2027/1228</p></td>  </tr></table>]]></description><link>https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63706</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 10:30:00</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Result of Underwriting Auction conducted on Oct